w: We turn un- filled _ to Thee a- gain.
w: To them that find _ Thee all in all.
w: And thirst our souls _ from Thee to fill.
w: Blessed when our faith _ can hold Thee fast.
w: Shed over the world _ Thy ho- ly light.
